{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18782","headline":"磨镜篇 · 刘禹锡","name":"磨镜篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流尘翳明镜，岁久看如漆。\n门前负局人，爲我一磨拂。\n萍开绿池满，晕尽金波溢。\n白日照空心，圆光走幽室。\n山神妖气沮，野魅真形出。\n却思未磨时，瓦砾来唐突。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}